{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-boost#card-zh","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-boost","commit":"c0d035dea154bde03da11a7945a76b8ddcc4c41d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-boost 是 DSH Web 的提示词增强插件，通过输入框工具栏按钮和 Shift+Tab 触发草稿重写。它在宿主侧调用当前会话或设置指定的 LLM，并提供逻辑优化、结构化重写和精简压缩风格。用户可查看原文与生成结果的流式预览，选择回填、复制或取消，并可撤销回填。设置页支持自定义系统提示词、生成参数、上下文选项和默认模型。适合希望在发送前整理提示词草稿的 DSH Web 用户；增强请求使用宿主配置的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1050-1090","lib/index.js:400-435","lib/index.js:504-600"]}
{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-boost#card-en","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-boost","commit":"c0d035dea154bde03da11a7945a76b8ddcc4c41d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-boost refines DSH Web prompt drafts via a button or Shift+Tab. Choose logic, structured, or concise rewriting and preview streamed output beside the original. Apply, copy, cancel, or undo. Settings support a custom system prompt, generation options, context, and model selection.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:1050-1090","lib/index.js:400-435","lib/index.js:504-600"]}
