{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-boost#feature-apply-undo","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-boost","commit":"c0d035dea154bde03da11a7945a76b8ddcc4c41d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-boost 的功能「回填与撤销」：用户确认预览后将增强文本写回输入框，并显示撤销操作以恢复原草稿；也可取消而不应用结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:400-420"]}
{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-boost#feature-settings","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-boost","commit":"c0d035dea154bde03da11a7945a76b8ddcc4c41d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-boost 的功能「增强设置页」：独立设置页可配置启用状态、模型来源、生成参数、上下文感知、默认风格和系统提示词，并通过设置接口保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:830-930","lib/index.js:641-675"]}
{"unit_id":"JianhangLy__dsh-prompt-boost#caveat-model","repo":"JianhangLy/dsh-prompt-boost","commit":"c0d035dea154bde03da11a7945a76b8ddcc4c41d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-boost 使用 DSH 宿主提供的 LLM；需有可用的会话路由、全局默认模型，或在设置中填写 provider 与 model，否则增强请求无法生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:400-410","lib/index.js:504-530"]}
